# --- LeetCUDA book（RFC-0.7）：解禁章节 tex，忽略构建产物（BOOK_PLAN §8.3） ---
!interview/book/**/*.tex
!interview/book/tests/*.sh
!interview/book/tests/*.h
!interview/book/references/**
